Rhoform benchmark (c) (ESP32-S3 devboard) — power-tree/assertion validation log

COMMITTED 2026-08-17T06:43:41Z under AMB-123 (M0 completion audit). Until then this file
was untracked: `.gitignore`'s `*.log` swallowed it while design.md and
assertions.yaml cited it as evidence. Unlike its four siblings the analysis
below is hand-computed, not captured tool output, so it is carried forward
as written; only the project's former name in this first line has changed
(AMB-122). Every figure in it was re-derived independently during the AMB-123
audit and agreed to the quoted digit.

This benchmark has no ngspice deck by design (design.md sec. 9), which
assertions.yaml now declares as `deck: null` so a deleted deck cannot look
like a deliberate absence.

Note on history: no validation.log existed for this deliverable before the
2026-08-15 fix round. The original 2026-08-14 validation evidence was embedded
inline in power-tree.yaml (summary_per_mode, voltage_at_ldo_input) and
